\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 During 2026, since joining the team in January, I have focused on building a strong understanding of the dbTRACE-Global and Mistre applications, taking ownership of assigned deliverables, strengthening application stability, addressing security and audit requirements, and contributing to the team's technology transformation objectives.\
