\f1\b \cf0 1. Application Handover and Knowledge Sharing
\f0\b0 \
Successfully completed the initial handover of the dbTRACE-Global project from the US team during my first two months. I developed an understanding of the dbTRACE-FIX and dbTRACE-TraceCore modules and actively participated in internal knowledge-transfer and reverse knowledge-transfer sessions to consolidate my understanding and support effective knowledge sharing within the team.\

\f1\b 2. Key Project Deliveries
\f0\b0 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0
\f1\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 OPUS GCP REST API Migration:
\f0\b0  Contributed to the team's first delivery in March, successfully implementing the OPUS GCP REST API migration for IRDS and ORDS.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 MSRB Reporting:
\f0\b0  Developed and delivered the MSRB reporting enhancement end to end. This included understanding the MSRB RCA workflow and STP assignment scenarios, enabling MSRB reporting configuration, setting up the DBEC Exchange configuration, retrieving and validating files from the server, and generating Navigator files. Coordinated with the DB Navigator team to validate successful control generation. The solution was tested in parallel and moved to production following successful confirmation.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 WI Production Issue:
\f0\b0  Successfully addressed the production issue involving the replay of 2823 records with discrepancies due to missing WI flags. Developed a script to execute the end-to-end replay process, supporting consistent and efficient resolution of the issue.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 NMA Affiliate Reporting Remediation:
\f0\b0  Progressed the NMA reporting remediation by completing the development of secondary-leg generation. Testing is currently ongoing, with continued focus on validating the implementation and supporting successful delivery.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

